#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:5
#: 08e17dee79704ebeaa97658a7698e60a
msgid "Intel RealSense T265"
msgstr "Intel RealSense T265"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:12
#: 109da657925c4b59959204c4d91a1f91
msgid ""
"This article explains how to setup an `Intel Realsense T265 "
"<https://store.intelrealsense.com/buy-intel-realsense-tracking-"
"camera-t265.html?_ga=2.225595998.511560227.1566178471-459370638.1562639781>`__"
" for use with ArduPilot as a substitude for a GPS allowing position control "
"modes like Loiter, PosHold, RTL, Auto to work. This method uses a python "
"script running on an RPI companion computer to send position information to "
"ArduPilot without the use of `ROS <https://www.ros.org/>`__.  The `setup "
"using ROS is here <https://ardupilot.org/dev/docs/ros-vio-tracking-"
"camera.html>`__."
msgstr ""
"本文介绍如何配置 `Intel Realsense T265 <https://store.intelrealsense.com/buy-intel-"
"realsense-tracking-"
"camera-t265.html?_ga=2.225595998.511560227.1566178471-459370638.1562639781>`__"
" 以与 ArduPilot 配合使用，作为 GPS 的替代方案，从而支持 Loiter、PosHold、RTL、Auto "
"等位置控制模式。该方案使用运行在 RPI 伴飞电脑上的 Python 脚本向 ArduPilot 发送位置信息，无需使用 `ROS "
"<https://www.ros.org/>`__。`使用 ROS 的配置方法见此 "
"<https://ardupilot.org/dev/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.html>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:15
#: a3544e6b016049f985e1d6278df15921
msgid "What to Buy"
msgstr "所需硬件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:17
#: 1191657f59714dbc9e2bce003454478d
msgid ""
"`Intel RealSense Tracking Camera T265 "
"<https://www.intelrealsense.com/tracking-camera-t265/>`__"
msgstr ""
"`Intel RealSense 追踪相机 T265 <https://www.intelrealsense.com/tracking-"
"camera-t265/>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:18
#: 76d07a62bf614ccea2a5ac62c894897d
msgid ""
"`Raspberry Pi 4 <https://www.raspberrypi.org/products/raspberry-"
"pi-4-model-b/>`__ (2GB or 4GB recommended, 8GB has issues) or `Raspberry Pi "
"3 <https://www.raspberrypi.org/products/raspberry-pi-3-model-b/>`__"
msgstr ""
"`Raspberry Pi 4 <https://www.raspberrypi.org/products/raspberry-"
"pi-4-model-b/>`__（推荐 2GB 或 4GB，8GB 版本有问题）或 `Raspberry Pi 3 "
"<https://www.raspberrypi.org/products/raspberry-pi-3-model-b/>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:19
#: 9c3e550a1e7c4634966b6ec25f18718f
msgid "16GB (or larger) SD card"
msgstr "16GB（或更大）SD 卡"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:20
#: 8b3da8691312493fb1b962ad7a191ea0
msgid ""
"`PiConnectLite <https://www.rpanion.com/product/pi-connect-lite-v2/>`__ to "
"connect the RPI to the autopilot (optional)"
msgstr ""
"`PiConnectLite <https://www.rpanion.com/product/pi-connect-lite-v2/>`__，用于将 "
"RPI 连接至飞控（可选）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:24
#: f49a02dbf6264db5a85e38b8d6934237
msgid ""
"The RPI4 supports USB3 which allows both **pose** + **image** data to be "
"captured from the camera.  The slower RPI3 only has USB2 meaning only "
"**pose** data can be captured although this is sufficient for most users."
msgstr ""
"RPI4 支持 USB3，可同时从相机采集**位姿**和**图像**数据。速度较慢的 RPI3 仅支持 "
"USB2，只能采集**位姿**数据，但对大多数用户已足够。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:27
#: 5e4f4bb329b74431bb7e4a79ef613442
msgid "Hardware Setup"
msgstr "硬件配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:33
#: 1be73c26fb9647de9e218fd2b0cfe23d
msgid ""
"Download the latest APSync Ubuntu image (`found here "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Companion/apsync/apsync-rpi-"
"ubuntu-t265-latest.img.xz>`__) to your PC and then flash it to the 16GB (or "
"larger) SD card using a tool such as `Etcher "
"<https://www.balena.io/etcher/>`__ or `Win32DiskImager "
"<https://sourceforge.net/projects/win32diskimager/>`__ and then insert it "
"into the RPI's SD Card slot"
msgstr ""
"在电脑上下载最新的 APSync Ubuntu 镜像（`从此处获取 "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Companion/apsync/apsync-rpi-"
"ubuntu-t265-latest.img.xz>`__），然后使用 `Etcher "
"<https://www.balena.io/etcher/>`__ 或 `Win32DiskImager "
"<https://sourceforge.net/projects/win32diskimager/>`__ 等工具将其烧录到 16GB（或更大）SD "
"卡，再将 SD 卡插入 RPI 的卡槽"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:34
#: cc54647f1adc4229bb520520493a14a5
msgid ""
"Mount the Intel RealSense T265 on the vehicle facing forward (see below for "
"information other orientations) using thick double sided tape or `David "
"Sastre's T265 mount "
"<https://www.dropbox.com/s/e3ias30czsn2q4t/Intel_RealSense_Tracking_Camera_T265_holder.STL?dl=0>`__"
" to better isolate the camera from vibrations"
msgstr ""
"使用厚双面胶或 `David Sastre 的 T265 支架 "
"<https://www.dropbox.com/s/e3ias30czsn2q4t/Intel_RealSense_Tracking_Camera_T265_holder.STL?dl=0>`__"
" 将 Intel RealSense T265 朝前安装在飞行器上（其他安装方向的信息见下文），以更好地隔离相机震动"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:35
#: dc22e8e616a24dee8c63742524bc9d12
msgid ""
"Connect the Intel RealSense T265's USB cable to one of the RPI4's blue USB3 "
"ports"
msgstr "将 Intel RealSense T265 的 USB 线连接到 RPI4 的蓝色 USB3 端口之一"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:36
#: 0994445bece24c7fa4748358aca8d57e
msgid "Connect the PiConnectLite's power cable to the battery (7V to 30V)"
msgstr "将 PiConnectLite 的电源线连接到电池（7V 至 30V）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:37
#: a1d9a9eb1c5d4d76a2e47cf71edea664
msgid ""
"Connect the PiConnectLite's serial cable to one of the autopilot's telemetry"
" ports (i.e. Telem1, Telem2). The only signals used in this cable are TX, RX"
" and GND. The other signals are NC."
msgstr ""
"将 PiConnectLite 的串口线连接到飞控的数传端口（如 Telem1、Telem2）。该线缆仅使用 TX、RX 和 GND 信号，其余为空脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:43
#: f2a448e546f9411c93ab6d37962c7164
msgid ""
"`David Sastre's T265 mount "
"<https://www.dropbox.com/s/e3ias30czsn2q4t/Intel_RealSense_Tracking_Camera_T265_holder.STL?dl=0>`__"
msgstr ""
"`David Sastre 的 T265 支架 "
"<https://www.dropbox.com/s/e3ias30czsn2q4t/Intel_RealSense_Tracking_Camera_T265_holder.STL?dl=0>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:46
#: c04c46d20ff347149d53ed6745809949
msgid "Configure ArduPilot"
msgstr "配置 ArduPilot"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:48
#: c178343abf80407fae7a3586e6d3ae08
msgid ""
"Connect to the autopilot with a ground station (i.e. Mission Planner) and "
"check that the following parameters are set:"
msgstr "使用地面站（如 Mission Planner）连接飞控，确认以下参数已正确设置："

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:50
#: 35174537a11b42ecb0f6ea53bcb09be4
msgid ""
":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 2 (MAVLink2).  Note this "
"assumes the RPI4 is connected to AutoPilot \"Telem2\" port."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 2（MAVLink2）。注意此处假设 RPI4 "
"连接到飞控「Telem2」端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:51
#: abda530772e248eaaae883a9e9d09a72
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 921 (921600 baud)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 921（921600 波特率）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:52
#: 5c2be7167630422db2b9d98d81efa401
msgid ""
"Optionally set :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS <SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` = 1024 (Don't "
"forward mavlink to/from) to block the RPI4/T265 mavlink messages from "
"reaaching the ground station"
msgstr ""
"可选设置 :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS <SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` = 1024（不转发 MAVLink）以阻止 "
"RPI4/T265 的 MAVLink 消息到达地面站"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:53
#: 508637f7cbcd487b82eed72ab26c5839
msgid ":ref:`VISO_TYPE <VISO_TYPE>` = 2 (IntelT265)"
msgstr ":ref:`VISO_TYPE <VISO_TYPE>` = 2（IntelT265）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:55
#: 216e9760340c422787111a0feaa069b4
msgid "Next setup the EKF3 to use the ExternalNav for position and velocity:"
msgstr "接下来配置 EKF3 使用 ExternalNav 作为位置和速度来源："

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:57
#: f6a930d37c364a60bd85942ae1bda47a
msgid ":ref:`EK3_SRC1_POSXY <EK3_SRC1_POSXY>` = 6 (ExternalNav)"
msgstr ":ref:`EK3_SRC1_POSXY <EK3_SRC1_POSXY>` = 6（ExternalNav）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:58
#: 3a2e5a1c2ab243749212843abf3d1ce7
msgid ":ref:`EK3_SRC1_VELXY <EK3_SRC1_VELXY>` = 6 (ExternalNav)"
msgstr ":ref:`EK3_SRC1_VELXY <EK3_SRC1_VELXY>` = 6（ExternalNav）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:59
#: c15b1852808b4cf59695041bdf8fd3b2
msgid ""
":ref:`EK3_SRC1_POSZ <EK3_SRC1_POSZ>` = 1 (Baro which is safer because of the"
" camera's weakness to high vibrations)"
msgstr ":ref:`EK3_SRC1_POSZ <EK3_SRC1_POSZ>` = 1（气压计，更安全，因为相机对高震动敏感）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:60
#: 44e0d61594814f88aa58df39b53d53be
msgid ":ref:`EK3_SRC1_VELZ <EK3_SRC1_VELZ>` = 6 (ExternalNav)"
msgstr ":ref:`EK3_SRC1_VELZ <EK3_SRC1_VELZ>` = 6（ExternalNav）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:61
#: 76c0b9109e5746a49521149e2da55bd9
msgid "Optionally set :ref:`GPS1_TYPE <GPS1_TYPE>`  = 0 to disable the GPS"
msgstr "可选设置 :ref:`GPS1_TYPE <GPS1_TYPE>` = 0 以禁用 GPS"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:63
#: 63529b4a8198410a968295dbd48bc5f2
msgid "If you wish to use the camera's heading:"
msgstr "如希望使用相机的航向："

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:65
#: eb16c9365a754faebc91e54293ba6ac5
msgid ""
":ref:`COMPASS_USE <COMPASS_USE>` = 0, :ref:`COMPASS_USE2 <COMPASS_USE2>` = "
"0, :ref:`COMPASS_USE3<COMPASS_USE3>` = 0 to disable all compasses"
msgstr ""
":ref:`COMPASS_USE <COMPASS_USE>` = 0，:ref:`COMPASS_USE2 <COMPASS_USE2>` = "
"0，:ref:`COMPASS_USE3<COMPASS_USE3>` = 0，禁用所有罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:66
#: 86605795d2eb4f20a92648956efdc582
msgid ":ref:`EK3_SRC1_YAW <EK3_SRC1_YAW>` = 6 (ExternalNav)"
msgstr ":ref:`EK3_SRC1_YAW <EK3_SRC1_YAW>` = 6（ExternalNav）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:68
#: 0d770fe890894d1b87e30c4832af50fc
msgid "If you wish to use the autopilot's compass for heading:"
msgstr "如希望使用飞控罗盘作为航向："

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:70
#: a199bde5fcbd443abfa3c684c5bf34db
msgid ":ref:`COMPASS_USE <COMPASS_USE>` = 1 (the default)"
msgstr ":ref:`COMPASS_USE <COMPASS_USE>` = 1（默认值）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:71
#: b9618edcd9b4412383815ee0509c8e2a
msgid ":ref:`EK3_SRC1_YAW <EK3_SRC1_YAW>` = 1 (Compass)"
msgstr ":ref:`EK3_SRC1_YAW <EK3_SRC1_YAW>` = 1（罗盘）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:72
#: 1d54f6509ff24b02994c149ab625fcdb
msgid ""
":ref:`RC7_OPTION <RC7_OPTION>` = 80 (Viso Align) to allow the pilot to re-"
"align the camera's yaw with the AHRS/EKF yaw before flight with auxiliary "
"switch 7.  Re-aligning yaw before takeoff is a good idea or loss of position"
" control (aka \"toilet bowling\") may occur."
msgstr ""
":ref:`RC7_OPTION <RC7_OPTION>` = 80（Viso Align），允许飞手在飞行前通过辅助开关 7 将相机偏航与 "
"AHRS/EKF 偏航重新对齐。起飞前重新对齐偏航是个好习惯，否则可能出现位置控制失效（即「马桶效应」）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:74
#: 81cee2e948a549dbb86977c231856ba0
msgid ""
"After the parameters are modified, reboot the autopilot.  Connect with the "
"ground station and (if using Mission Planner) right-mouse-button-click on "
"the map, select \"Set Home Here\", \"Set EKF Origin Here\" to tell ArduPilot"
" where the vehicle is and it should instantly appear on the map."
msgstr ""
"参数修改完成后，重启飞控。使用地面站连接后（如使用 Mission Planner），在地图上右键单击，选择「Set Home Here」>「Set "
"EKF Origin Here」，告知 ArduPilot 飞行器位置，飞行器图标应立即出现在地图上。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:76
#: aa7bece5cb8f47669f0008f733657e8d
msgid ""
"Just before flying, pick up the vehicle to a height of 1m and then put it "
"down again.  This allows the camera to calibrate its vertical scaling."
msgstr "飞行前，将飞行器抬至 1 米高再放下，使相机校准其垂直比例缩放。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:78
#: 5b2cac1497034488b56b454c62552b8d
msgid ""
"If you wish to switch between GPS and T265 see the :ref:`GPS/Non-GPS "
"Transitions <common-non-gps-to-gps>` wiki page"
msgstr ""
"如需在 GPS 和 T265 之间切换，请参见 :ref:`GPS/非 GPS 切换 <common-non-gps-to-gps>` wiki 页面"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:81
#: 87c4cca8e4e84665b14c0a2fd3b26765
msgid "System Overview"
msgstr "系统概述"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:86
#: 3460b5fba2f54e299410fc4ce970e845
msgid ""
"In a nutshell, the 6-DOF pose data (**position** and **orientation**) and "
"**confidence level** obtained from the Realsense T265 will be processed by "
"our python script and send to ArduPilot through MAVLink. Overall, the script"
" will do the following tasks:"
msgstr ""
"简而言之，Python 脚本将从 Realsense T265 获取的六自由度位姿数据（**位置**和**姿态**）及**置信度**，通过 "
"MAVLink 发送给 ArduPilot。脚本主要执行以下任务："

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:88
#: f5a8b2f0cf914da9baab0f01e6460fe5
msgid ""
"Obtain 6-DOF pose data and tracking confidence level data using relevant "
"APIs from ``pyrealsense2``, which is the Python wrapper for "
"``librealsense``."
msgstr ""
"通过 ``pyrealsense2``（``librealsense`` 的 Python 封装）的相关 API 获取六自由度位姿数据和跟踪置信度数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:89
#: 733e29b2b5954a7a8e74af818d131ef9
msgid ""
"Perform necessary matrix transformation to align the frames of the Realsense"
" T265 and NED frame as well as other processing steps."
msgstr "进行必要的矩阵变换，将 Realsense T265 的坐标系与 NED 坐标系对齐，并执行其他处理步骤。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:90
#: c4ea56fda4cf41d8ac8df95821a0a69f
msgid ""
"Pack pose data into MAVLink message `VISION_POSITION_ESTIMATE "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#VISION_POSITION_ESTIMATE>`__ and"
" confidence level data into a dummy message, then send them to ArduPilot at "
"a predetermined frequency so as to not `flood` the Autopilot with incoming "
"data."
msgstr ""
"将位姿数据打包为 MAVLink 消息 `VISION_POSITION_ESTIMATE "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#VISION_POSITION_ESTIMATE>`__ "
"并将置信度数据打包为虚拟消息，然后以预定频率发送给 ArduPilot，以避免「淹没」飞控的输入数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:91
#: 15c222a76b5e4f289409d42a71389fd1
msgid "Automatically set EKF home for simple setup and flying."
msgstr "自动设置 EKF Home，简化配置和飞行。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:95
#: c87c5adaf2e34d96bee7a6c49334efdf
msgid ""
"The choice of Python is optional, and you can use any `other wrappers "
"supported by librealsense "
"<https://github.com/IntelRealSense/librealsense/tree/master/wrappers#wrappers-"
"for-intel-realsense-technology>`__. ROS users can find the equivalent "
"article :ref:`here <ros-vio-tracking-camera>`."
msgstr ""
"Python 的选择是可选的，您也可以使用 `librealsense 支持的其他封装 "
"<https://github.com/IntelRealSense/librealsense/tree/master/wrappers#wrappers-"
"for-intel-realsense-technology>`__。ROS 用户可参阅 :ref:`此处 <ros-vio-tracking-"
"camera>` 的对应文章。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:100
#: 2bf05f52c140498b951017543ca4c3b9
msgid ""
"For the sake of brevity, explanation of the system will be kept short. More "
"in-depth discussion can be found in the following blog posts: `part 4 "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/integration-of-ardupilot-and-vio-tracking-"
"camera-part-4-non-ros-bridge-to-mavlink-in-python/44001>`__, `part 5 "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/integration-of-ardupilot-and-vio-tracking-"
"camera-part-5-camera-position-offsets-compensation-scale-calibration-and-"
"compass-north-alignment-beta/44984>`__."
msgstr ""
"为简洁起见，此处对系统的说明较为精简。更深入的讨论可参阅以下博文：`第 4 部分 "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/integration-of-ardupilot-and-vio-tracking-"
"camera-part-4-non-ros-bridge-to-mavlink-in-python/44001>`__、`第 5 部分 "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/integration-of-ardupilot-and-vio-tracking-"
"camera-part-5-camera-position-offsets-compensation-scale-calibration-and-"
"compass-north-alignment-beta/44984>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:103
#: 5efc177d8a0b4213886b286724b095ff
msgid "Install ``librealsense`` and ``pyrealsense2``"
msgstr "安装 ``librealsense`` 和 ``pyrealsense2``"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:105
#: 3f43dfc3cc1b45d2b7865060b9f786d3
msgid ""
"The Realsense T265 is supported via `librealsense "
"<https://github.com/IntelRealSense/librealsense>`__ on Windows and Linux. "
"Installation process varies widely for different systems, hence refer to "
"`the official github page "
"<https://github.com/IntelRealSense/librealsense>`__ for instructions for "
"your specific system:"
msgstr ""
"Realsense T265 在 Windows 和 Linux 上通过 `librealsense "
"<https://github.com/IntelRealSense/librealsense>`__ 提供支持。不同系统的安装过程差异较大，请参考 "
"`官方 GitHub 页面 <https://github.com/IntelRealSense/librealsense>`__ "
"获取适合您系统的说明："

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:107
#: d551ebc40d0a485dab6cd2e4967596b6
msgid ""
"`Ubuntu "
"<https://github.com/IntelRealSense/librealsense/blob/master/doc/installation.md>`__"
msgstr ""
"`Ubuntu "
"<https://github.com/IntelRealSense/librealsense/blob/master/doc/installation.md>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:108
#: 5f358a81e8ba4772b10e460c703687e8
msgid ""
"`Jetson "
"<https://github.com/IntelRealSense/librealsense/blob/master/wrappers/python/readme.md>`__"
" (Compiling from source is needed to get the Python wrapper "
"``pyrealsense2``)"
