#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:165
#: ca1014ab5625474dace3d170521623ef
msgid "How to run"
msgstr "运行方法"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:167
#: 4bcaaf5ab08a4ce89344964b1993a216
msgid ""
"Before the script can be run, the ``PYTHONPATH`` environment variable needs "
"to be added with the path to the ``pyrealsense2`` library. Alternatively, "
"copy the build output (``librealsense2.so`` and ``pyrealsense2.so`` in "
"``~/librealsense/build/``) next to the script. First, run the test script "
"``t265_test_streams.py`` to verify installation of ``pyrealsense2`` and the "
"T265 is connected."
msgstr ""
"运行脚本前，需在 ``PYTHONPATH`` 环境变量中添加 ``pyrealsense2`` "
"库的路径。或者，将编译输出文件（``~/librealsense/build/`` 中的 ``librealsense2.so`` 和 "
"``pyrealsense2.so``）复制到脚本旁边。首先运行测试脚本 ``t265_test_streams.py``，以验证 "
"``pyrealsense2`` 的安装和 T265 的连接。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:182
#: eb5bff2669fa4cad979390048b4fa6c3
msgid ""
"Modify parameters in the ``t265_to_mavlink.py`` script for your system "
"configuration. Most importantly, find and change the following parameters in"
" the script:"
msgstr "在 ``t265_to_mavlink.py`` 脚本中修改适合您系统配置的参数。最重要的是，找到并修改脚本中的以下参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:199
#: 778a1485d32945df950a1bb4e0b4b403
msgid ""
"The parameters can also be passed as input arguments from the command line. "
"Now let's run the main script:"
msgstr "参数也可以通过命令行输入参数传递。现在运行主脚本："

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:210
#: 7290441a1efe40b6a47cb30d3f6e33fb
msgid ""
"View all available input arguments: ``python3 t265_to_mavlink.py --help``"
msgstr "查看所有可用输入参数：``python3 t265_to_mavlink.py --help``"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:213
#: aa27c6e9d77f43e1b50297e0a0b9a20b
msgid "Verification before testing"
msgstr "测试前验证"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:215
#: f850d15e392945898031914d6e020ed4
msgid ""
"To verify that ArduPilot is receiving ``VISION_POSITION_ESTIMATE`` messages,"
" on Mission Planner: press ``Ctrl+F`` and click on “Mavlink Inspector”, you "
"should be able to see data coming in. The confidence level can be viewed in "
"message ``VISION_POSITION_DELTA``, field ``confidence``."
msgstr ""
"如需在 Mission Planner 上验证 ArduPilot 是否收到 ``VISION_POSITION_ESTIMATE`` 消息，请按 "
"``Ctrl+F`` 并点击「Mavlink Inspector」，应可看到数据进入。置信度可在消息 ``VISION_POSITION_DELTA``"
" 的 ``confidence`` 字段中查看。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:220
#: fa94886c259d413988e544b15ea3b608
msgid ""
"Changes in value of the tracking confidence level can also be notified on "
"Mission Planner’s message panel, HUD and by speech. These notifications will"
" pop up when the system starts and when confidence level changes to a new "
"state, for example from ``Medium`` to ``High``."
msgstr ""
"跟踪置信度的变化也可在 Mission Planner 的消息面板、HUD 和语音中获得通知。当系统启动及置信度切换到新状态时（例如从 "
"``Medium`` 变为 ``High``），通知将弹出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:222
#: 996fac64cf9b4c778c4f37cc4756f629
msgid ""
"To enable speech in Mission Planner: Tab Config/Tuning > Planner > Speech > "
"tick on \"Enable speech\"."
msgstr ""
"在 Mission Planner 中启用语音：Tab 「Config/Tuning」>「Planner」>「Speech」> 勾选「Enable "
"speech」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:223
#: 1c081de7fa0c4139af5a5eb80296c3f7
msgid ""
"If there are some messages constantly displayed on the HUD, you might not be"
" able to see / hear the confidence level notification."
msgstr "如果 HUD 上持续有消息显示，可能无法看到/听到置信度通知。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:224
#: 3b00fdab2bf34a3889fa1b2325a3d3be
msgid ""
"If telemetry is slow, notification might be dropped. You can still see the "
"latest message in MAVLink Inspector, message ``STATUSTEXT``."
msgstr "如果数传速度较慢，通知可能丢失。仍可在 MAVLink Inspector 的 ``STATUSTEXT`` 消息中查看最新消息。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:225
#: a8a919d03510429b986ae53ecb0ec267
msgid ""
"If telemetry is very slow, it may be flooded by VISION_POSITION_ESTIMATE "
"messages. You can disable message forwarding by setting bit 10 in "
"``SERIALx_OPTIONS``. Be aware you will not receive VISION_POSITION_ESTIMATE "
"in GCS anymore."
msgstr ""
"如果数传非常慢，可能被 VISION_POSITION_ESTIMATE 消息淹没。可通过设置 ``SERIALx_OPTIONS`` 的第 10 "
"位禁用消息转发。注意，之后地面站将无法再收到 VISION_POSITION_ESTIMATE 消息。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:229
#: dec6b4b0b9c9490c8812eb625ab55e88
msgid "Ground Test"
msgstr "地面测试"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:231
#: 78b878b712f34a8eb5d56d5147065991
msgid ""
"After power on, ssh into the companion computer, navigate to the script and "
"run: ``python3 t265_to_mavlink.py``."
msgstr "上电后，SSH 进入伴飞电脑，切换到脚本目录并运行：``python3 t265_to_mavlink.py``。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:233
#: a158640678dd4ac8994ce139256da60b
msgid "Wait until the quadcopter icon appears on the map of Mission Planner."
msgstr "等待四旋翼图标出现在 Mission Planner 地图上。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:235
#: c88563c40c3e4e02ae22578909f39bd3
msgid ""
"Pick-up the vehicle and walk it around, check that the vehicle’s position "
"movements are shown on the map. The trajectory of the vehicle on the map "
"should reflect the real movements without too much distortion or overshoot. "
"Below is an example of walking in a 2m x 2m square."
msgstr ""
"拿起飞行器四处移动，检查地图上显示的飞行器位置是否跟随移动。地图上的轨迹应真实反映实际移动，不应有过多失真或超调。以下是在 2m x 2m "
"方形区域内行走的示例。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:240
#: 3fdda019fd61420ba1585d86bd6dd0b6
msgid ""
"During the test, view the confidence level and verify tracking performance. "
"For most applications you should trust the full 6dof pose only in **high** "
"confidence. If you only need the rotation (3dof), lower confidence poses can"
" be used."
msgstr ""
"测试过程中，查看置信度并验证跟踪性能。对于大多数应用，只有在**高**置信度下才应信任完整的 6DoF "
"位姿数据。如仅需姿态（3DoF），可使用较低置信度的位姿数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:242
#: b486fb6d7c4145508f145f89514b7e23
msgid ""
"If the external navigation data is lost for any reason (tracking lost, "
"script is interrupted etc.), reboot the Autopilot."
msgstr "如果外部导航数据因任何原因丢失（跟踪丢失、脚本中断等），请重启飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:246
#: 908e7075523b4e39b123b4090aebd13b
msgid ""
"If you are flying in a confined environment, it might be best to go around "
"the safety perimeter of flying, view the trajectory on the map, then "
"remember not to fly/setup mission beyond that perimeter."
msgstr "如果在密闭环境中飞行，建议先围绕安全飞行边界飞一圈，在地图上查看轨迹，然后注意不要将飞行或任务规划超出该边界。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:249
#: 96dff31fd90449e9920aad9fd39e4661
msgid "Flight Test"
msgstr "飞行测试"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:251
#: 613ff1a1d44e405d84d7f8e98d857375
msgid "For your first flight:"
msgstr "首次飞行："

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:253
#: 97f99c6144a1461abf5632b45e993889
msgid "Takeoff in Stabilize or Alt-Hold, check that the vehicle is stable."
msgstr "在 Stabilize 或 AltHold 模式下起飞，确认飞行器稳定。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:255
#: 04bf72cf009a45668b62145ed24cf08b
msgid ""
"Move the vehicle around and observe the position on Mission Planner to see "
"if tracking is stable."
msgstr "移动飞行器并在 Mission Planner 上观察位置，确认跟踪稳定。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:257
#: 39581cef93754b4cb24279f4a6c1e19f
msgid ""
"Switch to Loiter, but always ready to switch back to Stabilize/Alt-Hold if "
"anything goes awry."
msgstr "切换至 Loiter 模式，但随时准备切回 Stabilize/AltHold。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:259
#: 16e77db0f90741a69ad94c95c8718e6f
msgid ""
"Otherwise, the vehicle should hover stably and able to keep its position."
msgstr "飞行器应能稳定悬停并保持位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:261
#: b6d7712142264b2eb85241ffa56d18bb
msgid ""
"Move the vehicle around (translate, rotate) at varying speed, always ready "
"to switch back to Stabilize/Alt-Hold."
msgstr "以不同速度平移、旋转飞行器，随时准备切回 Stabilize/AltHold。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:263
#: cfc0e3e3b29c4c15bce41eaca36aa72b
msgid ""
"If everything works as expected, next time you can arm and takeoff in Loiter"
" mode."
msgstr "一切正常后，下次可直接在 Loiter 模式下解锁起飞。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:267
#: def7decd83464791bc72d426646e3286
msgid ""
"Always confirm that position feedback is running ok before switching to "
"Loiter mode. Also look out for the safety boundary in your environment, i.e."
" where tracking might get lost due to lack of features, fast or rotation "
"movement."
msgstr "切换到 Loiter 模式前，务必确认位置反馈运行正常。同时注意环境中的安全边界，即可能因特征不足、快速移动或旋转而导致跟踪丢失的区域。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:270
#: 3ac8c665526b493cb7f078654f9538e3
msgid "Indoor and Outdoor Experiments"
msgstr "室内与室外实验"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:279
#: 9f08585c0e4347ef97e7feefc37906a2
msgid "DataFlash logging"
msgstr "DataFlash 日志"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:281
#: 1694e577753b42418fa3ee45e4ffa324
msgid ""
"The visual odometry information will appear in the ``VISO`` dataflash log "
"messages."
msgstr "视觉里程计信息将出现在 ``VISO`` DataFlash 日志消息中。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:282
#: d2ae0943193744dfac9beab1e40c4ea4
msgid "EKF's visual odometry information will appear in XKFD messages"
msgstr "EKF 的视觉里程计信息将出现在 XKFD 消息中"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:285
#: 1dd81cdd95bd44e5bb62db4dc7a05665
msgid "Autorun at boot"
msgstr "开机自启"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:287
#: 9d4da82b3c4a43afa1b12fd223ea6555
msgid "The script can be run automatically at boot time."
msgstr "脚本可在开机时自动运行。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:289
#: 0983220827a4455d8f2f67fe06938f26
msgid ""
"Download or create a shell file ``t265.sh``, modify the path to "
"`t265_to_mavlink.py` script in this shell file, then make it executable:"
msgstr "下载或创建 shell 文件 ``t265.sh``，修改其中 `t265_to_mavlink.py` 脚本的路径，然后添加可执行权限："

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:305
#: e913a0a7f90a4c379eb833f0d427802f
msgid ""
"Depends on your system, use `any method <https://blog.frd.mn/how-to-set-up-"
"proper-startstop-services-ubuntu-debian-mac-windows/>`__ to make the script "
"autorun at boot. In the steps below, we will use ``systemd`` to turn it into"
" a service."
msgstr ""
"根据您的系统，使用 `任意方法 <https://blog.frd.mn/how-to-set-up-proper-startstop-"
"services-ubuntu-debian-mac-windows/>`__ 使脚本开机自启。以下步骤中，我们将使用 ``systemd`` "
"将其注册为服务。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:307
#: f5754e177b9745b7b8b7f8c43a7c0a0b
msgid ""
"Let’s create a file ``/etc/systemd/system/t265.service`` with the following "
"content. Set your actual username after ``User=`` and set the proper path to"
" your ``t265.sh`` in ``ExecStart=``."
msgstr ""
"创建文件 ``/etc/systemd/system/t265.service``，内容如下。将 ``User=`` 后填入您的实际用户名，并在 "
"``ExecStart=`` 中设置正确的 ``t265.sh`` 路径。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:329
#: 9a798bebe8c343d48857833eea33534b
msgid ""
"That’s it. We can now start the service and automatically get it to start on"
" boot:"
msgstr "就这些。现在可以启动服务并设置开机自启："

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:338
#: 50ca9b372fc84414aa187f87eeb3597d
msgid "EKF3 Source Transitions with OpticalFlow"
msgstr "EKF3 源切换与光流"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:340
#: c58192a49feb400f8c08767d16e86839
msgid ""
"If switching between this and OpticalFlow is desired, see :ref:`extnav-"
"optiflow-transitions`"
msgstr "如需在本方案与光流之间切换，请参见 :ref:`extnav-optiflow-transitions`"
